    40	# c) Implicit-assumption audit of the seed solver:
    41	#    - Seed assumption "every non-blue diagonal pixel is an independent trigger" fails.
    42	#      We must collect 4-connected components and keep only 2x2 squares.
    43	#    - Seed assumption "a trigger fires as soon as the draw loop touches it" also fails.
    44	#      Here activation depends on the relative arrangement of multiple blocks, so the solver
